widgets_values:
These images are frames sampled in time order, one per second, from a single video. Describe the video for a video model, in plain English, under 150 words:
- how many people (or characters, animals) are visible, and where each one is in the frame;
- what the main performer does, in order: body motion, steps, gestures, hands, head turns, gaze, facial expression, mouth movement or speech;
- interactions with objects or other people;
- the camera: framing (close-up, medium, wide) and movement;
- the setting: the place, the background and the light.
Never describe anyone's clothes, hair, face, skin or body type. No timestamps or seconds; describe the order (first, then, finally). Output only the description.

